    "detailed_description": "<h1>About Us</h1><p>Interested in collaboration, please add on QQ\uff1a923818862<br>Official QQ Group for Communication \u2460\uff1a578526424</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure World of Reality and Fantasy.</h2></strong><br>Experience the joy of adventure brought by a diverse fantasy world, form different teams to explore unique adventures. The game offers 200 main and side quests, seeking answers hidden at the center of the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/050054b2920c95664b83afa8c9b0e3f3.poster.avif?t=1701478480\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/050054b2920c95664b83afa8c9b0e3f3.webm?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/050054b2920c95664b83afa8c9b0e3f3.mp4?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original two-tier combat mechanics for an exhilarating turn-based battle experience.</h2></strong><br>Emphasizing character strategy combinations, master the release order of skills and ultimates, and feel the performance of battles with different teams.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/604c91db15bafbfbb0918da50cb33082.poster.avif?t=1701478480\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/604c91db15bafbfbb0918da50cb33082.webm?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/604c91db15bafbfbb0918da50cb33082.mp4?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ensemble storytelling, activate bonds to form a team.</h2></strong><br>Recruit from 60 featured characters, each with their own story. Find like-minded companions and build a formidable team that sweeps through challenges.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure World of Reality and Fantasy.</h2></strong><br>Experience the joy of adventure brought by a diverse fantasy world, form different teams to explore unique adventures. The game offers 200 main and side quests, seeking answers hidden at the center of the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/050054b2920c95664b83afa8c9b0e3f3.poster.avif?t=1701478480\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/050054b2920c95664b83afa8c9b0e3f3.webm?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/050054b2920c95664b83afa8c9b0e3f3.mp4?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original two-tier combat mechanics for an exhilarating turn-based battle experience.</h2></strong><br>Emphasizing character strategy combinations, master the release order of skills and ultimates, and feel the performance of battles with different teams.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/604c91db15bafbfbb0918da50cb33082.poster.avif?t=1701478480\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/604c91db15bafbfbb0918da50cb33082.webm?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667660/extras/604c91db15bafbfbb0918da50cb33082.mp4?t=1701478480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ensemble storytelling, activate bonds to form a team.</h2></strong><br>Recruit from 60 featured characters, each with their own story. Find like-minded companions and build a formidable team that sweeps through challenges.",
